Thank you for your interest in contributing to IPEDS_longitudinal.
This project is intended to remain open, reproducible, and available for others to use and improve.
License of contributions
The software in this repository is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (GPLv3).
By submitting a pull request, commit, patch, or other contribution to this repository, you agree that your contribution may be incorporated into the project and distributed under the GPLv3.
You must have the legal right to submit the contribution. Please do not submit code or other material copied from a third-party source unless you have verified that its license permits its inclusion in this project.
You retain any copyright you otherwise hold in your contribution, subject to the rights granted to the project and its users under the GPLv3.
Data and IPEDS
The project processes publicly available data from the Integrated Postsecondary Education Data System (IPEDS), maintained by the National Center for Education Statistics (NCES).
Contributors should not add third-party data to this repository unless the data's terms permit redistribution and the source and applicable terms are clearly documented.
Pull requests
When submitting a pull request, please describe:
what the change does;
why the change is needed;
any changes to the resulting data;
any relevant changes in IPEDS source data or methodology; and
any limitations or known issues.
Contributors are encouraged to maintain reproducibility and transparency in the data-processing workflow.
